  conditions with highest prevalence are examined as well.books.google.com"}, {"study_index": 15, "title": "Advance     
  II: a prospective, randomized study assessing safety and efficacy of bioabsorbable steroid‐releasing sinus            
  implants", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE Endoscopic sinus surgery (ESS) for chronic rhinosinusitis (CRS) may be compromised  
